"""Balancer V2 venue for Subnet 112 — the champion's uncovered liquidity gap.

Exact output quotes via Vault.queryBatchSwap (real pool math, no reimplementation).
Two route shapes, both revert-safe (validated on a mainnet fork):

  * DIRECT: a pool holding both tokens -> approve + Vault.swap
  * 2-HOP:  tin -> hub (WETH/USDC) -> tout across two pools -> approve + Vault.batchSwap

best_route() returns whichever yields the most output; the solver only uses it
when it beats the champion's quote by a margin, so weak routes self-exclude.
"""
